Part of the Nethack Makefile.

# GAMEDIR also appears in config.h as "HACKDIR".
#
# note that 'make install' believes in creating a nice tidy GAMEDIR for
# installation, free of debris from previous NetHack versions --
# therefore there should not be anything in GAMEDIR that you want to keep
# (if there is, you'll have to do the installation by hand or modify the
# instructions)
GAMEDIR  = /usr/games/lib/$(GAME)dir # change to ./games/$(game)dir
SHELLDIR = /usr/games # change to ./games
MANDIR   = /usr/man/man6 # ask your system admin to place the man page.
MANEXT   = 6

You need to change the above variables in Makefile to point to where you want  
the game installed.  Also checkout the install files in the Nethack source, you  
will find some helpful hints on what you need to edit to set everything up.   
Also note that you may have to edit the config.h file.  Hope this helps.

